  "pitfalls": [
    "Response and resolution times are skewed by a few very old tickets; read the median next to the average.",
    "Business-hours and calendar-hours timers give very different numbers; do not mix them across teams or periods.",
    "Backlog, resolved % and resolution time use each ticket's current status, so recent periods always look less resolved.",
